---

<PageLayout page="membership">
  <Container class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:gap-14 py-10 lg:py-14">
    <DisplayText class="text-center">
      Flick TT is home to over 250 members, from complete beginners picking up a bat for the first time to nationally ranked players. Membership is a great way to save money for table tennis enthusiasts who join our sessions regularly. You get reduced rates on all activities at the club, free entry to our workshops, and a place in one of London's friendliest table tennis communities, open seven days a week at Decathlon Surrey Quays.
    </DisplayText>
    <Button
      as="a"
      size="lg"
      href="https://bookwhen.com/flicktt/memberships"
      target="_blank"
      class="m-auto"
    >
      Become a member
    </Button>
  </Container>
  <PointsRow pointConfig={pointConfig} />
  <div class="border-b border-flick-dark">
    <PhotoGallery />
  </div>
  <Container class="lg:gap-14 pt-10 pb-14 lg:pt-14">
    <MembershipBenefits />
  </Container>
  <Faqs faqConfig={faqConfig} />
</PageLayout>
